---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy | NARA Studio"
  description="How NARA Studio uses application details to assess fit and reply about working together."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <main id="main">
    <header class="page-hero">
      <div class="shell stack">
        <span class="eyebrow">Privacy</span>
        <h1>How application details are used.</h1>
        <div class="stack measure">
          <p>
            NARA Studio collects the information in the application form to assess whether the Warm Market Activation Method is a fit and to reply about next steps.
          </p>
          <p>
            We do not ask for payment details, passwords or other unnecessary sensitive data through this website.
          </p>
          <p>
            Until a CRM or form endpoint is connected, submitted applications are validated in the browser. Do not include confidential customer data, donor records or anything you would not send in an introductory email.
          </p>
          <p>
            We will not sell your information. If you want details removed after submitting, email the studio using the contact method provided in any reply.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
